# The six capsule tiles the /games/ shelf shows and their six name plates, copied
# from deion_assets by its scripts/sync_sprites.py — the only way art enters this
# folder. Run it from the working-set root, because the site has no deion_assets
# symlink:
#
#     python3 deion_assets/scripts/sync_sprites.py --list insiculous_web/public/images/capsules/sync.list
#
# and `--check` to prove the copies still match the pinned commit below (the
# working set's scripts/check-sprite-sync.sh runs that over every list, this one
# after the games').
#
# The sync owns this whole directory: its non-check path deletes every file here
# that this list does not name, so nothing else may be committed beside the synced
# files. The .sheet.ron sidecars beside the PNGs are the sync's contract; the site
# never reads them. The quarantined `ai_` prefix stays on the copies.
#
# deion_assets a1ff3631b724b8bcaf7ceca4d2381e582b8a1076
ai/capsules/tong/ai_tong_capsule_256x256.png
ai/capsules/food_pyramid/ai_food_pyramid_capsule_256x256.png
ai/capsules/toast_busters/ai_toast_busters_capsule_256x256.png
ai/capsules/bratdog/ai_bratdog_capsule_256x256.png
ai/capsules/meatieroids/ai_meatieroids_capsule_256x256.png
ai/capsules/chicken_coop/ai_chicken_coop_capsule_256x256.png
ai/capsules/tong/ai_tong_name_256x64.png
ai/capsules/food_pyramid/ai_food_pyramid_name_256x64.png
ai/capsules/toast_busters/ai_toast_busters_name_256x64.png
ai/capsules/bratdog/ai_bratdog_name_256x64.png
ai/capsules/meatieroids/ai_meatieroids_name_256x64.png
